    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469840/extras/be617400be3e4c5efe62f71cfb118c5b.avif?t=1750259029\" width=800 height=356 /></span>Dive into a thrilling adults-only sandals &amp; sorcery adventure!  <br>A gorgon upstart has moved into the ruins outside of Amara's small village. Little by little, men and women have begun disappearing from town. Concerned by this, the village's four strongest heroes venture into the castrum ruins to solve the mystery; but they do not return. The local innkeeper, Amara, gets down and dirty to solve the mystery and restore the joy and revelry to her village.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469840/extras/16db01d57e0c41ffc930e251d6a51990.avif?t=1750259029\" width=800 height=267 /></span>Explore the connected levels of the <strong>Stone Oasis</strong> in 2.5D action platforming gameplay! Hunt its labyrinth for pieces of the Crystal Voyorbs, providing magical glimpses into salacious scenes that Amara uses to unravel the mystery of the castrum ruins and reunite her friends. Meet allies and enemies, discover steamy scenes through dialog and hidden locations, and engage in action-oriented erotic boss battles to bust through to the secret of the evil villain corrupting the castrum!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
